        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n\n    actor Admin\n\n    participant UI as SaaS Dashboard\n    participant API as FastAPI Backend\n    participant Knowledge as Knowledge Service\n    participant Storage as Object Storage\n    participant Parser as Document Parser\n    participant Chunker as Chunking Service\n    participant Embed as Embedding Service\n    participant VectorDB as pgvector\n    participant DB as PostgreSQL\n    participant Manager as Knowledge Manager\n    participant Agent as Agent Runtime\n    participant Events as Event Bus\n\n\n    Admin-&gt;&gt;UI: Upload document\n\n    UI-&gt;&gt;API: Submit file + metadata\n\n\n    API-&gt;&gt;Knowledge: Create ingestion job\n\n\n    Knowledge-&gt;&gt;Storage: Store original document\n\n    Storage--&gt;&gt;Knowledge: Document location\n\n\n    Knowledge-&gt;&gt;Parser: Extract document content\n\n    Parser--&gt;&gt;Knowledge: Extracted text\n\n\n    Knowledge-&gt;&gt;Chunker: Split text into chunks\n\n    Chunker--&gt;&gt;Knowledge: Document chunks\n\n\n    Knowledge-&gt;&gt;Embed: Generate embeddings\n\n\n    Embed--&gt;&gt;Knowledge: Vector representations\n\n\n    Knowledge-&gt;&gt;VectorDB: Store embeddings\n\n\n    Knowledge-&gt;&gt;DB: Store document metadata\n\n\n    VectorDB--&gt;&gt;Knowledge: Index created\n\n\n    Knowledge-&gt;&gt;Manager: Activate knowledge base\n\n\n    Manager-&gt;&gt;DB: Update status READY\n\n\n    Manager-&gt;&gt;Events: Publish KnowledgeIndexed\n\n\n    Events--&gt;&gt;Agent: Knowledge available\n\n\n    Agent-&gt;&gt;DB: Load updated knowledge configuration&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="ySirkflwYDD05Z-J9VoX-1331">
